OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fand night will be mostly dry with
OL,7,Fclear periods and only a chance of an
OL,8,Fodd light shower around the west coast
OL,9,Fand Eilean Siar. Turning chilly in
OL,10,Fsheltered glens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells in the morning, sunshine
OL,14,Fturning hazier as cloud spreads east
OL,15,Fin the afternoon. The odd spot of rain
OL,16,Fpossible in the west by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
