OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FOutbreaks of locally heavy rain on
OL,7,FMonday. Scattered showers,
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy, on Tuesday. Bright
OL,9,Fspells and a few showers Wednesday
OL,10,Fmorning, rain spreading east later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
